+Flight Deck Restaurant & Lounge,KSLE,Salem McNary Field,Salem,OR,on-airport,PNW,Seed list,https://flightdeckrestaurant.com,,"On-field restaurant established in 1968 at Salem McNary Field with windows on three sides giving panoramic views of the runway and Cascade Mountains. Northwest American cuisine with homemade soups, desserts and a full bar. A classic $100 hamburger destination on the I-5 corridor. Mon–Fri 11AM–9PM · Sat–Sun 8AM–9PM.",open,,,,
+Ellie's at the Airport,KAWO,Arlington Municipal Airport,Arlington,WA,on-airport,PNW,Seed list,,,"On-field diner at Arlington Municipal with direct runway views and a devoted local following. Classic American breakfast and lunch — the omelets and French fries draw particular praise. A lively spot with a full bar and a mix of pilots, hangar tenants and locals. Mon–Fri 8AM–2PM · Sat–Sun 8AM–2PM.",open,,,,
+Volo,KOXC,Waterbury-Oxford Airport,Oxford,CT,on-airport,Northeast,Freshness check 2026-08,https://voloatoxford.com/,,"Took over the old Restaurant 121 space in the Oxford terminal and kept the runway views. Casual fine dining — burgers, Neapolitan pizza, and a proper dinner service Thursday through Saturday. Lunch Tue–Sun 11AM–3PM · Dinner Thu–Sat 5PM–9:30PM.",open,,,,
+Fourth & Field,6B6,Minute Man Air Field,Stow,MA,on-airport,Northeast,Freshness check 2026-08,https://www.fourthandfield.com/,,"Farm-to-table New England cooking in Nancy's old space at Minute Man, with window seats over the runway and a patio. Mushroom truffle gnocchi and steak frites at dinner; weekend brunch draws a crowd. A step upmarket from the classic airport diner. Wed–Fri 11AM–3PM & 4PM–8PM · Sat 9AM–3PM & 4PM–8PM · Sun 9AM–3PM · Closed Mon–Tue.",open,,,,
+Fly In Cafe,7FL6,Spruce Creek Fly-In,Port Orange,FL,near-airport,FL,Freshness check 2026-08,https://flyincafeportorange.com/,,Important: Spruce Creek is a private residential airpark with a strict invitee policy — you cannot fly in to eat here without an invitation from a resident. Arrive by car through the guarded gate. Aviation-themed room with taxiway seating; the pizza is what regulars order. Tue–Thu 8AM–8PM · Fri–Sat 8AM–9PM · Sun 8AM–8PM · Closed Mon.,open,,,,
+Cafe Volo,KFOK,Francis S. Gabreski Airport,Westhampton Beach,NY,on-airport,Northeast,Freshness check 2026-08,https://www.cafevolowhb.com/,,"Small café tucked under the control tower at Gabreski, facing the runway, run by a CIA-trained chef-owner. Breakfast and lunch done properly — Volo taco trio, eggs Benedict, grits and biscuits — with seasonal dinner service in summer. Wed–Sun 8AM–3PM · Closed Mon–Tue.",open,,,,
+Hangar 28 Kitchen & Events,KGMU,Greenville Downtown Airport,Greenville,SC,on-airport,SC,Freshness check 2026-08,https://hangar28greenville.com/,,"Opened July 2026 in the former Runway Café space on the South Ramp, behind a 16-foot glass hangar door looking onto the active runway. Scratch kitchen — deli sandwiches, parmesan-crusted pita melts, crispy rice and sashimi plates — plus cocktails with house mixers. Still new, so call ahead. Tue–Sun 11AM–3PM · Closed Mon.",open,,,,
+Tantrums Flightside Cafe,KBOW,Bartow Executive Airport,Bartow,FL,on-airport,FL,Freshness check 2026-08,https://tantrumscafe.com/,,"Old Florida cooking in the Bartow terminal, in the space Runways left behind. Smash burgers, tacos, gator bites, and shrimp and grits. Breakfast through early lunch only — the kitchen shuts at 2PM. Mon–Sat 7AM–2PM · Closed Sun.",open,,,,
+Elevation 89,KOCF,Ocala International Airport,Ocala,FL,on-airport,FL,Freshness check 2026-08,https://www.elevation89attheocalaairport.com/,,"Named for the field elevation, this is a full restaurant and bar in the Ocala terminal with ramp views — a real dinner destination rather than a snack counter. Note the 11AM open: this is a lunch or dinner run, not a breakfast fly-in. Daily 11AM–9PM.",open,,,,
+Starduster Cafe,7S5,Independence State Airport,Independence,OR,on-airport,PNW,Freshness check 2026-08,,,"Runway-side diner at Independence State, about 200 feet from free tie-downs on one of Oregon's busiest residential airparks. Breakfast is the reason to come — corned beef hash, country fried steak, and a half-pound burger that has earned its $100 hamburger reputation. Outdoor seating faces 16/34. Kitchen closes at 2PM. Mon–Sat 6AM–2PM · Sun 7AM–2PM.",open,,,,
+Buzz Inn Steakhouse,S43,Harvey Field,Snohomish,WA,on-airport,PNW,Freshness check 2026-08,https://buzzinnsteakhouse.com/,,"Steakhouse and lounge on the field at Harvey, with a deck overlooking the grass strip and the skydiving operation. Aged Angus steaks and all-day breakfast; the Buzz Benedict carries the morning. Courtesy car available for the run into historic downtown Snohomish. Runway 15L/33R is 2,672 feet and only 36 wide, and the parallel turf strip is closed November through May. Sun–Thu 7AM–9PM · Fri–Sat 7AM–10PM.",open,,,,
+The Airplane Restaurant,KCOS,Colorado Springs Airport,Colorado Springs,CO,near-airport,Mountain,Freshness check 2026-08,https://theairplanerestaurant.com/,,"Dining inside a 1953 Boeing KC-97 tanker — 42 seats in the fuselage, cockpit open to walk through. Not on the airfield: it sits outside the fence, a ten-minute walk or short crew-car ride from the KCOS FBOs. Themed American menu built on Angus steaks and oversized sandwiches. Ask about ramp fees before you go, and mind the 6,187-foot density altitude on departure. Sun–Thu 11AM–8PM · Fri–Sat 11AM–9PM.",open,,,,
